// Events
section#events.section.section-xl.bg-default
	.container
		.row
			.col.text-center
				h3.h6  events
				h2 Upcoming events
		.row.row-30.justify-content-center
			.col-lg-8
				.box.box-schedule(data-animate!={class: 'fadeInUp'} )
					h5.box-schedule-title October 18
					.box-schedule-desc
						h6.box-schedule-desc-title time
						.box-schedule-desc-value 8:30am
					.box-schedule-desc
						h6.box-schedule-desc-title event
						.box-schedule-desc-value Do you have an interest in assisting in our Liturgies/Masses? We are looking for anyone that feels called to serve as a lector, altar server, and sacristan.

				.box.box-schedule(data-animate!={class: 'fadeInUp'})
					h5.box-schedule-title October 26
					.box-schedule-desc
						h6.box-schedule-desc-title time
						.box-schedule-desc-value 1:00pm - 2:00pm
					.box-schedule-desc
						h6.box-schedule-desc-title event
						.box-schedule-desc-value Come join other parishioners of our church and go on a weekend adventure to a US National Forest. We'll be camping, cooking, hiking, and praying.

				.box.box-schedule(data-animate!={class: 'fadeInUp'} )
					h5.box-schedule-title November 1
					.box-schedule-desc
						h6.box-schedule-desc-title time
						.box-schedule-desc-value 6:00pm to 8:30pm
					.box-schedule-desc
						h6.box-schedule-desc-title event
						.box-schedule-desc-value We are excited to host the Catholic Retreat VI, our first in-person retreat in 2021! Take your fall break to reconnect with God and build relationships.

				.box.box-schedule(data-animate!={class: 'fadeInUp'} )
					h5.box-schedule-title November 8
					.box-schedule-desc
						h6.box-schedule-desc-title time
						.box-schedule-desc-value 9:00pm to 10:30pm
					.box-schedule-desc
						h6.box-schedule-desc-title event
						.box-schedule-desc-value In the hustle and bustle of our lives, we need to take time to listen to the still small voice of the Spirit. Our fall silent retreat is on Friday, November 5 through Sunday, November 7.

				.box.box-schedule(data-animate!={class: 'fadeInUp'} )
					h5.box-schedule-title November 11
					.box-schedule-desc
						h6.box-schedule-desc-title time
						.box-schedule-desc-value 10:00pm to 11:30pm
					.box-schedule-desc
						h6.box-schedule-desc-title event
						.box-schedule-desc-value The second session of Contemplating God: Thinking About Love. This series will be led by Nova Forum Senior Fellow and executive director, Professor David Albertson.

